  "limitations": [
    "This is a measured comparison of actual modes, not identical browser-engine versions or a release performance guarantee. External Chrome was headless in both browser modes. Electron was instrumented through its main-process inspector.",
    "All profiles/workspaces were fresh. Electron included opening/migrating a legacy workspace; OS file caches were not cleared.",
    "RSS is summed across processes and can double-count shared memory; ps CPU is lifetime averaged.",
    "Some external-browser processes were still exiting at the three-second residual snapshot; no desktop child remained. No benchmark workspace/profile references remained in process command lines after the batch.",
